                <pb facs="1183" n="1071" sameAs="frus:frus1935v03/pg1071"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">811.5294/593a: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to
                        the Ambassador in Japan</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Grew</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1935-03-22T19:00:00-05:00">March 22, 1935—7 p.m.</date></dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>45. United Press report from Arizona today states that the Arizona State
                    Legislature adjourned yesterday and that the alien land bills died on the
                    calendar.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Hull</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
